<div class="pt-tab-wrap" id="pt-tab-wrap">
  <button class="pt-tab-btn" id="pt-tab-btn"><span class="ic">☰</span><span>行程页签</span><span class="cur" id="pt-tab-cur"></span></button>
  <div class="pt-tab-panel">
    <div class="pt-tab-title">◈ 旅 程 足 迹 ◈</div>
    <div class="pt-tab-chips" id="pt-tab-chips"><div class="pt-tab-empty">正在读取旅程足迹…</div></div>
    <div class="pt-tab-tip">点击页签跳转至该段旅程的开始楼层</div>
  </div>
